<title>LATVIA: ISSUE OF TWO-YR T-BILLS PLANNED FOR APRIL.</title>
<headline>ISSUE OF TWO-YR T-BILLS PLANNED FOR APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia plans to issue two-year Treasury bills from the end of April and may issue five-year paper next year, Finance Minister Robert Zile said on Friday.</p>
<p>Zile said the short-term paper would be kept as it better reflected developments in the money markets.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
